Package: laudacode
Version: 0.4.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: curl, rust, tar
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Anon4You/Laudacode
Description: Fast, lightweight AI coding agent for your terminal
 LaudaCode is a pure Rust AI agent that lives in your terminal.
 It reads your project, edits files, runs commands and fetches
 web docs using any OpenAI-compatible API (OpenAI, OpenRouter,
 Groq, DeepSeek, Together, Ollama, LM Studio, and more).
 Supports approval modes, image input, streaming responses,
 12 color themes, ambient effects, session persistence, and
 slash commands.
